                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Action 4 - Zoom to a node.

When the Camera Action receives Node Names and no camera, it creates a "zoomTo" action: the active camera zooms to fit the matching nodes, using the Camera Motion.

The node name is the nickname of the glTF 2.0 Display component ("Box"). Objects named with the ShapeDiver "name" attribute are addressed as &lt;nickname&gt;.&lt;name&gt;, e.g. Box.top.</item>
